  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math> be an&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, the common difference of this <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;which maximise the product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math>is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
